DownloaderResultsPage and DownloaderMediaCard hardcode Color(0xFFF8F9FA), Color(0xFFF1F3F5), Color(0xFFE9ECEF), and Color(0xFF212529) instead of MaterialTheme.colorScheme tokens, creating white cards with dark text on dark surfaces and dark-on-dark empty states.
